  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CB35521",
    "sub_id": "37750",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>\n<div>評分標準</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; 出缺席&nbsp; ：&nbsp; &nbsp; 30%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; 期中考試&nbsp; ：30%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; 期末考試&nbsp; ：40%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &sect; 補救措施：10% 專業證照加分+期末報告</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Grading Criteria</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Attendance：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 30%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Midterm Exam： 30%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Final Exam：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;40%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &sect; Remedial Measures：10% Certification Bonus + Final Report</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1.準時出席：每週上課需準時到場，點名與課程參與納入學期評分，無故缺席達三次以上者將影響總成績。\n2.積極參與：鼓勵主動提問、參與討論與小組報告，展現思考與準備。\n3.電子設備使用：上課期間請將手機靜音或關機，僅限於課程需求使用電腦或平板，不得處理無關事務。\n4.作業與報告繳交：請依規定時限繳交所有作業與報告，逾期未繳無正當理由者將扣分處理。\n5.分組協作：各組成員應共同分工，個別貢獻將納入評量，嚴禁代做或全由一人執行。\n\nClassroom Policies\n1. Attend class on time; 3+ unexcused absences affect grades.\n2. Engage actively in discussions and group work.\n3. Use devices only for class purposes; silence phones.\n4. Submit all assignments on time; late work is penalized.\n5. Ensure fair group contribution; no outsourcing allowed.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "1.財務管理為商學系基礎學科，請定期預習指定章節內容，加強課堂理解與實作能力，避免落後進度。\n2.商學系同學畢業後若以金融服務業為職志，課程設計將鼓勵同學參與金融證照考試，此為金融業求職的基本門檻，並在課程中帶入金融時事加以演練，請同學培養關注金融時事的習慣，課堂間會有時事案例練習，不公告事前通知，請持續保持學習狀態。\n3.期中與期末評量將包含計算與申論題型，建議學生熟悉財務公式與概念的應用。\n\nCourse Reminders\n1. Finance is a core business subject; preview chapters regularly to stay on track and strengthen applied skills.\n2. Students aiming for careers in financial services are encouraged to pursue certification exams; current events will be integrated without prior notice—stay engaged.\n3. Midterm and final assessments include both calculation and essay questions; review financial formulas and concepts thoroughly.",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>本課程重視誠信學習與原創思考，學生在任何作業、報告、測驗與考試中，不得有抄襲、代寫、作弊、竄改資料或其他違反學術倫理之行為。書面報告的參考資料與數據應明確標示出處，尊重智慧財產權。違反者將依校規處理，並可能影響學期總成績。學術誠信是財務管理專業素養的一部分，期盼學生共同維護良好學習風氣。</div>\n\n<div>Students must uphold honesty and originality in all coursework. Plagiarism, cheating, data tampering, or any academic misconduct is prohibited. Sources must be properly cited. Violations may result in penalties and affect final grades. Integrity is key to professional development in finance.</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "Y"
  },
